cff-version: 1.2.0
type: dataset
title: "RitelAI: Retail Location Suitability Assessment for Jabodetabek"
abstract: "Processed spatial dataset for machine learning-based suitability assessment of retail expansion locations (Alfamart and Indomaret) in the Jakarta-Bogor-Depok-Tangerang metropolitan area. Includes 35 spatial predictors per 100×100 m grid cell, outlet-level sentiment aggregation, development-holdout partition, and candidate locations with SHAP explanations."
